## Problem Statement
Making sure that only HWR-employees can enter a specific page (studbüro.html


## Decision
Seperating these two processes in into two different methods and sessions order to maintain order aintain clearity, also because different authentification data is required in each login roles ("user" & "mitarbeiter") which also makes sure that a student user cannot enter the site the the employees use to work (-->loginbp.py def s/-anmeldung)


## Regarded Options

Cretion one universal login route that checks the input data and based of off that redirects the user to their page of destination. The pros of that would be the less confusing route and general simplicity for future changes but that would come at the cost if it being more prone to bugs, due to potential database table mixing (student and mitarbeiter).                                                               

                                                               


